{"id":"en_public-divorce-the-tycoon-s-mad-pursuit","title":"Public Divorce: The Tycoon's Mad Pursuit","titleEn":"Public Divorce: The Tycoon's Mad Pursuit","description":"Evelyn Moretti, heir to a mafia empire, was secretly married to Damian Cole, an underground syndicate kingpin. For seven years she concealed her identity, quietly using her family’s wealth to pull him out of repeated crises and build his empire. Then, on a family trip, Damian brought his first love, took Evelyn’s seat, and abandoned her by the roadside. Heartbroken, she shed the housewife role and began freezing investments, revoking privileges, and pulling the hidden strings that had kept the Cole family afloat. Damian dismissed her as powerless until his empire collapsed without her support. Piece by piece, he understood that his wealth and status had always been hers. Evelyn filed for divorce and returned to lead the Moretti Consortium, taking back what was never his rather than destroy","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/public-divorce-the-tycoons-mad-pursuit/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/public-divorce-the-tycoons-mad-pursuit/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm534/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_public-divorce-the-tycoon-s-mad-pursuit_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm534/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_public-divorce-the-tycoon-s-mad-pursuit_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dm534/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_public-divorce-the-tycoon-s-mad-pursuit_3","title":"Episode 3